Summary: Get a specific todo by ID
Tags: Todos
Auth required: yes
Parameter (path, required): id integer
Response 200: Todo found {id: integer, title*: string, isComplete: boolean}
Response 401: Unauthorized
Response 404: Todo not found

POST /users/login
Summary: Login and get access token
Tags: Users
Auth required: no
Request body (application/json): {email*: string(email), password*: string}
Response 200: Login successful {tokenType: string, accessToken: string, expiresIn: integer, refreshToken: string}
